    layout_order 3700
    tags logistics production
    research_time 150
    requires council_of_elders
    modifier RoadSpeed multiplier 1.10 building Road
    modifier ProductionCycleTime multiplier 0.909091 building Inn
    modifier RoadCapacity additive 2 building Road
